### MaterialSales — UPDATE PUT (expects 200 OK; total recomputed and lot stock adjusted by the difference)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1
@materialLotId = 1

PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/material-sales/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Venta de cartón a transformadora (corregida)",
  "buyerName": "Papeles Reciclados de la Costa S.A.S.",
  "materialLotId": {{materialLotId}},
  "quantityKg": 300,
  "unitPricePerKg": 550,
  "saleDate": "2026-10-01"
}
